{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2021-09-02 17:18:00', 'title': 'DOW ANNOUNCES $2 MILLION SUPPORT TOWARD HURRICANE IDA RELIEF, RECOVERY AND RESILIENCY', 'text': 'MIDLAND, MICH., SEPT. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IN RESPONSE TO THE WIDESPREAD DEVASTATION CAUSED BY HURRICANE IDA IN LOUISIANA, DOW\u202f(NYSE: DOW) AND THE DOW COMPANY FOUNDATION ANNOUNCED THE CONTRIBUTION OF $2 MILLION TO SUPPORT IMMEDIATE RELIEF AND LONG-TERM RECOVERY EFFORTS ASSOCIATED WITH THE STORM AND ITS AFTERMATH.'}